# "Destroy each artifact with mana value X or less" (CR 202.3): Bot2's Cogwork Librarian is an artifact creature of mana value 4, so
# Meltdown with X = 4 is destroyed it - one below its mana value it is spared, at X = 4 it goes (the equal case; the other scenario is the
# other side of the boundary). Bot2's four Moxen (mana value 0) go in both, and only artifacts: Bot1's Mountain stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Meltdown
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Cogwork Librarian
Island x12

